Lyra
====

Lyra is a privacy-focused browser by Quad4. It is a Firefox ESR fork.
The product name is Lyra. The vendor is Quad4. It is not Mozilla Firefox.
Overlay paths still use void for the branding directory, prefs, and themes.

Firefox-derived files
---------------------
Firefox is a trademark of the Mozilla Foundation. Lyra does not use Mozilla
or Firefox trademarks as the product name. Engine code comes from Mozilla
Firefox source tarballs under MPL-2.0. This git repository does not vendor
that source.

Quad4 brand
-----------
The Quad4 mark, lockups, colors, and related artwork are the brand of Quad4
(https://quad4.io/branding). They are included here as vendor marks. Do not
present them as Mozilla artwork. Do not use Mozilla's official Firefox branding.

Lyra mark
---------
The Lyra bird-and-ring mark is product branding by Quad4. It is not Mozilla
artwork. Do not use Mozilla's official Firefox branding. Source art lives at
branding/void/assets/lyra-mark.png.

