uBlock Origin
-------------
uBlock Origin is copyright Raymond Hill and contributors, licensed under
GPL-3.0-only. Lyra does not vendor the XPI in git. The fetch script downloads
a hash-pinned signed XPI from upstream. See extensions/ublock/.

LibreWolf and arkenfox
----------------------
Vendor prefs and policies are inspired by LibreWolf settings and arkenfox
user.js. Those projects remain copyright their authors under their licenses.
Lyra does not copy their full files. Citations live in prefs/void.cfg.

No analytics
------------
Lyra does not add first-party telemetry, crash phone-home, or usage analytics.
